    "title": "Cisco-IOS-XE-iad-oper",
    "description": "This module contains a collection of YANG definitions\n     for Industrial Asset Discovery (IAD) operational data.\n     IAD feature enables users to view details of directly connected end devices\n     through different protocols (CDP, LLDP, PROFINET, IPDT, CIP etc.)\n     This is implemented for learning devices in industrial networks which include end devices\n     such as programmable logic controllers (PLCs) and Intelligent Electronic Devices (IED).\n\n     Copyright (c) 2025 by Cisco Systems, Inc.\n\n     All rights reserved.\n\nCisco IOS-XE operational state data (read-only).\n**Category:** Other Services\n**Paths:** 5",
    "version": "17.18.1"
  },
